# No rewrite rules on purpose.
# Navigation is in-page scroll / hash only. There is no client router.
# Do not add `/* /index.html 200`: Cloudflare can apply _redirects even when
# /assets/*.js, /assets/*.css, or /logo.svg exist, and redirects run before
# _headers. Vite preview is not Cloudflare edge proof.
# Do not add a top-level 404.html. Pages default SPA fallback (no 404.html)
# remains available later if client routes are added. Not proven on Pages edge.
